  "summary": "noblox-asset.js ships obfuscated Windows dropper in postinstall and main entry",
  "details": "Typosquat of the legitimate noblox.js Roblox API wrapper. The package ships two heavily obfuscated (obfuscator.io) files not present upstream: postinstall.mjs and the declared main lib/index.js. postinstall.mjs constructs a URL for a Windows executable named TRLX.exe on a Netlify (*tlify.app) subdomain, downloads it under os.homedir(), spawns PowerShell to execute it, and uses PowerShell Set-ItemProperty for registry-based persistence. lib/index.js has the same obfuscation preamble and top-level https/http/fs/os/path imports as postinstall.mjs, so requiring the package also triggers dropper-shape behavior. The README, homepage, and badges are copied verbatim from the legitimate noblox.js repository; no legitimate re-export or Roblox API code is present.",
